---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="RM Sites — Clinic websites in 1 day | RM CREATIVES" description="Fast, conversion-ready, SEO-ready websites for medical and aesthetic clinics. Clear scope, modern stack and launch in one day.">
<main>
<section class="hero shell"><div class="eyebrow top"><span>RM / PRODUCT 03</span><span>WEBSITES / CONVERSION / SEO</span></div><div class="hero-grid"><div><h1>Clinic website.<br/><em>Live in 1 day.</em></h1></div><aside><p>For clinics that need a serious website without turning it into a three-month agency project.</p><a href="/contact">Build my clinic website ↗</a></aside></div></section>

<section class="statement"><div class="shell statement-grid"><span class="eyebrow">THE IDEA</span><h2>Not every website<br/>needs a long project.</h2><p>When the scope is clear, the process can be radically shorter. We focus on what patients actually need: understand the clinic, find the service, trust the doctor and make contact.</p></div></section>

<section class="compare shell"><div class="old"><span class="eyebrow">THE USUAL WEBSITE PROJECT</span><h3>Weeks of process.</h3><div class="rows"><p><span>Briefs & meetings</span><b>WEEKS</b></p><p><span>Design rounds</span><b>+</b></p><p><span>Development</span><b>+</b></p><p><span>Plugin setup</span><b>+</b></p><p><span>Launch date</span><b>?</b></p></div><small>A simple clinic website can easily become a large project because the process grows faster than the actual need.</small></div><div class="new"><span class="eyebrow">RM SITES</span><h3>One focused build day.</h3><div class="day"><strong>01</strong><span>DAY</span></div><div class="equals"><span>→</span><strong>STRUCTURE<br/>DESIGN<br/>BUILD<br/>LAUNCH</strong></div><small>Clear scope, prepared content and fast decisions make the one-day format possible.</small></div></section>

<section class="journey"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">PATIENT-FIRST</span><h2>A clinic website has<br/>one real job.</h2></div><div class="journey-flow"><div><b>01</b><strong>UNDERSTAND</strong><span>What is this clinic and can it help me?</span></div><i>→</i><div><b>02</b><strong>FIND</strong><span>Which service or doctor do I need?</span></div><i>→</i><div><b>03</b><strong>TRUST</strong><span>Why should I choose this clinic?</span></div><i>→</i><div><b>04</b><strong>CONTACT</strong><span>How do I book or ask a question?</span></div></div></div></section>

<section class="included shell"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT WE BUILD IN</span><div class="included-grid"><div><b>01</b><h3>Clear structure</h3><p>Services, doctors and essential patient information organised around real decisions — not internal clinic logic.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Conversion paths</h3><p>Every important page has a clear next step: call, message, form or booking.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Responsive design</h3><p>The site is designed for the phone first because that is where much of patient traffic arrives.</p></div><div><b>04</b><h3>SEO foundations</h3><p>Semantic structure, titles, descriptions, sitemap, canonicals and clean URLs are part of the build.</p></div><div><b>05</b><h3>Analytics</h3><p>Forms and key actions can be connected to measurement from launch.</p></div><div><b>06</b><h3>Fast architecture</h3><p>No heavy WordPress setup for a simple marketing site. Fewer moving parts, less maintenance.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="timeline"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head light"><span class="eyebrow">THE BUILD DAY</span><h2>From blank page<br/>to live website.</h2></div><div class="time-grid"><div><span>09:00</span><h3>Structure</h3><p>Finalise pages, hierarchy, patient journey and content priorities.</p></div><div><span>11:00</span><h3>Design</h3><p>Build the visual system directly around the real content.</p></div><div><span>14:00</span><h3>Build</h3><p>Responsive implementation, forms, SEO basics and analytics.</p></div><div><span>17:00</span><h3>QA + launch</h3><p>Check mobile, links, forms, metadata and publish.</p></div></div><small class="note">The one-day format assumes an agreed scope and prepared source content. Larger multilingual or migration projects are scoped separately.</small></div></section>

<section class="seo shell"><div class="seo-grid"><span class="eyebrow">SEO FROM DAY ONE</span><h2>Launch clean.<br/>Don't repair later.</h2><div class="seo-list"><p><span>01</span>Page hierarchy</p><p><span>02</span>Metadata</p><p><span>03</span>Canonical URLs</p><p><span>04</span>Sitemap</p><p><span>05</span>Responsive performance</p><p><span>06</span>Analytics foundation</p></div></div></section>

<section class="not"><div class="shell not-grid"><span class="eyebrow">IMPORTANT</span><h2>Fast does not mean<br/>generic.</h2><p>The speed comes from a focused process and a constrained scope — not from dropping your logo into a template. The site still has to feel like your clinic and support your patient journey.</p></div></section>

<section class="cta shell"><span class="eyebrow">RM SITES</span><h2>Need a clinic website without the endless website project?</h2><p>Send us your current site, services and what needs to change. We'll tell you whether the one-day format fits.</p><a href="/contact">Build my clinic website ↗</a></section>

<section class="related shell"><div class="related-head"><span class="eyebrow">RELATED CASES / WEBSITES</span><h2>Real clinic websites we've rebuilt.</h2></div><div class="case-cards"><a href="/cases/epiline/website"><span class="eyebrow">EPILINE / WEBSITE</span><h3>Rebuild a clinic website without losing search visibility.</h3><strong>44</strong><p>pages · LV / RU</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a><a href="/cases/denta/website"><span class="eyebrow">DENTA / WEBSITE</span><h3>Turn the website into acquisition infrastructure.</h3><strong>NEW</strong><p>website built around services, search and conversion</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a><a href="/cases/union-klinika/website"><span class="eyebrow">UNION KLINIKA / WEBSITE</span><h3>Rebuild a clinic website with a limited budget.</h3><strong>LV / RU</strong><p>patient-first bilingual website</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a></div></section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
